S_human_f_prophet="Subject: a beautiful human Prophetess, a holy leader in her late twenties, with an ethereal face, pale skin, luminous glowing white-blue eyes, and long straight ash-blonde hair under a sheer veil. She wears a radiant golden sun-ray headdress, sheer layered ivory and pale gold robes with bare shoulders and sacred symbols, and raises one open hand holding a floating sphere of light. Otherworldly, devout. $SEXY"
